        "fit_reason": "The code uses session cookies without explicit SameSite attribute settings, which can make them vulnerable to CSRF attacks if set to 'None'."
      },
      {
        "cwe_id": "CWE-1004",
        "cwe_name": "Sensitive Cookie Without 'HttpOnly' Flag",
        "fit_reason": "The code does not explicitly set the HttpOnly flag on session cookies, which could expose them to client-side script access."
      },
      {
        "cwe_id": "CWE-367",
        "cwe_name": "Time-of-check Time-of-use (TOCTOU) Race Condition",
